    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d755">

                <pb facs="0715" n="709" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg709"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Uhl to Baron Saurma.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-05-16"><hi rendition="#italic">May 16,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge
                    receipt of your note of the 2d instant, with which was inclosed a copy of the
                    report of the commanding officer of the German cruiser <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Sperber</hi> in relation to the transportation of Mataafa and his followers
                    to the Marshall Islands.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Edwin F. Uhl</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
